# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
# NFC SMART BUSINESS CARD PLATFORM
## Complete SaaS Web Application – Production-Ready Development

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, UI/UX designer, Firebase specialist, security engineer, and SaaS application developer.

Build a complete, professional, production-ready NFC Smart Business Card platform. This must be a fully functional application, not a static UI prototype or a collection of disconnected screens.

The application will allow customers to create digital business profiles, customize physical NFC business cards, purchase cards, and share their contact information through NFC tapping or QR scanning.

The application must support three main portals:
1. Customer Portal
2. Printer Portal
3. Admin and SuperAdmin Portal

The final application must be deployable through GitHub and Netlify, using Firebase as its backend infrastructure.

IMPORTANT: Do not just generate a project plan, wireframe, or sample code. Implement the actual working application, including authentication, database integration, storage, business logic, security, responsive layouts, and functional workflows.

