### Standard card dimensions

The physical NFC card size must be:

85.6 mm × 54 mm

Equivalent:
3.37 × 2.13 inches.

Use a landscape card orientation by default.

Allow an optional vertical card orientation if supported by the selected template.

### Technical print specifications

- Exact trim size: 85.6 × 54 mm.
- Print resolution: 300 DPI.
- Print-ready PDF output.
- Provide 3 mm bleed outside the trim size.
- Include safe margins.
- Export front and back as separate pages or clearly defined sides.
- Maintain exact aspect ratio.
- Provide crop marks where supported.
- Keep all essential information inside the safe area.

The final print design must never be distorted or resized unpredictably.

