# 8. QR CODE GENERATION AND MANAGEMENT

This must be implemented securely.

### Customer QR code

Generate the QR code only after the payment has been successfully verified.

QR destination:

https://yourdomain.com/p/{unique-profile-slug}

QR code requirements:
- High-resolution PNG
- SVG format
- Scannable with standard smartphone cameras
- Error correction level suitable for printing
- White quiet zone
- Sufficient print contrast
- No unnecessary decoration that affects scanning

Store the QR code in Firebase Storage.

Associate it with:
- User ID
- Order ID
- Profile URL
- QR version
- Creation timestamp

### QR privacy

Before purchase:
- Customer cannot see the actual QR code.
- Customer cannot download the actual QR code.
- Customer sees only the QR placeholder in the design studio.

After purchase:
- The actual QR code becomes available to the printer and authorized admin users.
- The customer may see their QR code in their order details only if an admin setting explicitly permits it.
- Do not automatically expose the QR image to customers.

### SuperAdmin QR functionality

SuperAdmin must have a special QR management facility.

SuperAdmin can:
- Enter any publicly accessible URL.
- Generate a QR code.
- Preview the QR code.
- Download PNG.
- Download SVG.
- Download high-resolution QR artwork.
- Associate the QR with a customer or order if required.
- Store and manage generated QR codes.

