# 22. IMPORTANT BUSINESS RULES

These requirements must be strictly followed.

1. Every newly registered account receives USER role.
2. Only Admin and SuperAdmin can manage users, subject to permissions.
3. Only SuperAdmin can manage SuperAdmin accounts.
4. Customer public profile pages must be accessible without login.
5. Only selected profile fields are publicly displayed.
6. A customer cannot obtain an actual QR code before successful payment.
7. Before payment, the card editor displays only a QR placeholder.
8. Payment must be verified server-side.
9. Actual QR code generation must happen after verified payment.
10. Printer receives the final card design with the actual QR code already positioned.
11. Printer sees only assigned orders.
12. Admin and SuperAdmin can access all orders.
13. Physical card size must be 85.6 × 54 mm.
14. Printer PDF must include 3 mm bleed and 300 DPI output.
15. NFC must point to the same public profile as the QR code.
16. Customer receives order confirmation email after successful payment.
17. Estimated delivery communication must state 10–15 days within India.
18. SuperAdmin can generate QR codes from any publicly accessible URL without requiring a customer purchase.
19. All important administrative actions must be logged.
20. Customer profile updates must not invalidate an already assigned public profile URL.
21. If a profile is deactivated, its public page must show a configurable unavailable message.
22. A customer must not be able to manipulate payment status, QR generation status, printer assignment or role through browser developer tools.

